  "_notes": "Ballroom - an open-roof hexagonal gallery in deathball's flat pit bowl (~165x135m flat at x235-400 z585-720): six 25.5m low walls (y5-8.5) in a hexagon ring (R24, ~41m across) the player can vault, plus invisible ballOnly 'hull' fences continuing each wall to y40 and a ballOnly cap slab at y40 — the player sees open sky and can jet out, balls stay sealed. Floor slab tops at y5 (spawn eye y8 drops ~1m in). balls.zone: spawn inside r14, pursuit aims at the room center, leash snaps any tunneled ball back inside 27m of center (corner 24m). Solo entry: OFFLINE > BALLS > BALLROOM, or deep link /?mode=classic&map=ballroom. Classic mode forces variant-0 balls so ballMix is host-only."
